# a simple [[balance]] for [[weighing]] [[foodstuff]]s etc; the thing to be weighed hangs from the short side of a [[beam]]; the long side has [[graduated]] [[notch]]es for a standard [[weight]].  Shorted form of ''stilyard beme''  meaning ''rod'' or ''beam'' used in a ''steel yard''.